        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239500/extras/ac35ce8ebce2d6aae28e7367bc1644b6.webp?t=1780091512\" width=332 height=33 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239500/extras/b03307bf59e324edda9c5d0b7d43bed3.poster.avif?t=1780091512\" width=616 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239500/extras/b03307bf59e324edda9c5d0b7d43bed3.webm?t=1780091512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239500/extras/b03307bf59e324edda9c5d0b7d43bed3.mp4?t=1780091512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a shipwreck, you find yourself on a mysterious island that isn’t marked on any map. Yet, standing tall on this enigmatic island is a lighthouse - our only path to salvation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cloud Cats are friendly and playful creatures that warmly welcome new guests. However, what happened to the lighthouse keeper? And are the kittens truly innocent in his disappearance?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239500/extras/558b297e89a2f6616010829ada7b7fb6.webp?t=1780091512\" width=121 height=29 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239500/extras/55a03f6cc7b059050c0c62e04e8f2792.poster.avif?t=1780091512\" width=616 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239500/extras/55a03f6cc7b059050c0c62e04e8f2792.webm?t=1780091512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239500/extras/55a03f6cc7b059050c0c62e04e8f2792.mp4?t=1780091512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each cat is unique and brings its own magic to your journey. Attract kittens to solve puzzles, and they will assist you on your unforgettable adventure.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239500/extras/1b8a6397c842da1330ceb2f96181d7ae.webp?t=1780091512\" width=154 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239500/extras/5e524af886b9e8b5de6ac44daa56d6f8.poster.avif?t=1780091512\" width=616 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239500/extras/5e524af886b9e8b5de6ac44daa56d6f8.webm?t=1780091512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239500/extras/5e524af886b9e8b5de6ac44daa56d6f8.mp4?t=1780091512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your wits to find common ground with the unusual creatures you encounter along the way. Who said a shoggoth doesn't love ice cream?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239500/extras/c35a6545be1028f8ff100be6737e3240.webp?t=1780091512\" width=197 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239500/extras/8b5a0361d8f5baa9c4a9bef432527885.poster.avif?t=1780091512\" width=616 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239500/extras/8b5a0361d8f5baa9c4a9bef432527885.webm?t=1780091512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239500/extras/8b5a0361d8f5baa9c4a9bef432527885.mp4?t=1780091512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every ordinary object can be transformed into something extraordinary. Got a piece of fence? Why not turn it into some rails? They look so alike!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239500/extras/1f50c4a837e5c72459fe204ecd9b1ad5.webp?t=1780091512\" width=127 height=33 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239500/extras/32f9ecb7fedf37a5d6c8bff07b4f98d9.poster.avif?t=1780091512\" width=616 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239500/extras/32f9ecb7fedf37a5d6c8bff07b4f98d9.webm?t=1780091512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239500/extras/32f9ecb7fedf37a5d6c8bff07b4f98d9.mp4?t=1780091512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every corner of the island holds secrets and unique challenges. Solve riddles with the help of magical kittens, conquer mini-games, and explore the island — perhaps you will be the one to uncover the secrets of the Cloud Cats!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239500/extras/ac35ce8ebce2d6aae28e7367bc1644b6.webp?t=1780091512\" width=332 height=33 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239500/extras/b03307bf59e324edda9c5d0b7d43bed3.poster.avif?t=1780091512\" width=616 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239500/extras/b03307bf59e324edda9c5d0b7d43bed3.webm?t=1780091512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239500/extras/b03307bf59e324edda9c5d0b7d43bed3.mp4?t=1780091512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a shipwreck, you find yourself on a mysterious island that isn’t marked on any map. Yet, standing tall on this enigmatic island is a lighthouse - our only path to salvation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cloud Cats are friendly and playful creatures that warmly welcome new guests. However, what happened to the lighthouse keeper? And are the kittens truly innocent in his disappearance?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239500/extras/558b297e89a2f6616010829ada7b7fb6.webp?t=1780091512\" width=121 height=29 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3239500/extras/55a03f6cc7b059050c0c62e04e8f2792.poster.avif?t=1780091512\" width=616 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com